*.big
*.hwl
*.xa
*.str
*.xnf
*.vag
*.vab
*.vh
*.vb
*.lev
*.vrm
*.ctr
*.mpk
*.tim
*.lng
BIGFILE.BIG
KART.HWL
assets/
